          "quote":"The product is expressed as a declared asset graph over the state\ntransitions relevant to the product's work (P0, P3).",
          "section_id":"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ODD.md#ODD%2F5.%20Graph%20model",
