    {
      "conditions": [],
      "definition": "Source-described workflow over the graph: bind current target, locate admissible vectors, traverse one vector, materialise next asset, prove that vector closed and continue until the selected target closes. One declared vector/edge traversal is the profile's bounded unit of probabilistic compute.",
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line":406,
          "quote":"The workflow is a traversal over the graph: bind the current target;\nlocate the next admissible vectors; traverse one vector; materialise the\nnext asset; prove the vector closed; continue until the selected target\ncloses. The graph is the declared program space of the product (P0, P5).",
          "section_id":"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ODD.md#ODD%2F5.%20Graph%20model%2FTraversal",
