      "definition": "A structural responsibility layer expresses one capability class, which the product binds to local domain semantics and the GTL carrier exposes through lawful transitions. Examples are bootstrap/intake, design, implementation, qualification, release, operational transition and retrofit; they are not mandatory instance names.",
