      "key":"active_layer_binding",
      "statement":"Each active layer should explicitly bind local typed assets/nodes, public graph-function carriers, required carried environment, proof/closure surfaces and projection/query surfaces; audits should distinguish shared law from local semantics. Copying another product's asset names without semantic need is accidental doctrine transfer, not method reuse. A prose-only capability lacking typed assets, graph functions and proof lanes is under-built.",
