      "key":"catalogue_and_gtl_publication",
      "statement":"The live line must publish a machine-readable function catalogue; each retained function should expose at least name, inputs, outputs, intent and public/helper role. Prose/prompt-only callable surfaces leave the product under-built. Publish public carriers, traversed graphs, typed node/vector surfaces and bound semantic jobs/equivalent outer contracts. Publish live refined inner boundaries explicitly through lawful GTL surfaces; callers always bind the outer public contract, never hidden inner vectors.",
