      "key":"admission_and_execution_authority_distinction",
      "statement":"ABG admission authority is then the graph-native specialisation of transformation admission completeness owned by ACTIVATION §4 and applied by DESIGN_MODULE. Broader ABG execution, supervision, retry and projection authority still derives from ODD and is not reclassified as admission authority. F_P/F_H remain the declared ODD projections of candidate-production/human-adjudication roles.",
      "uncertainty":"The complete enclosing-relation admission semantics are referenced but not supplied."
