      "statement":"Projections cannot redefine ABG facts or reconstruct alternate authority. Catalogue views reconcile to admitted module/public carrier; ownership/start-target views derive from or structurally compare against their admitted carrier; runtime views derive from ABG facts/events/replay/projection truth. Domain overlays fail closed on missing, stale or structurally divergent carriers. Same names with different inputs, outputs, vectors, declarations, ownership or closure law denote different truth surfaces until reconciled. Projection negative proof must include structural drift as well as missing truth.",
